  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  english: '<color=#5AA5FF><b>GRIP</b></color> (side button) - grab objects, pull
    door handles

    <color=#F2A33A><b>TRIGGER</b></color> - press the button of
    a remote in your hand (TV / Fan)

    <color=#7CE68C><b>LEFT STICK</b></color>
    - move        <color=#7CE68C><b>RIGHT STICK</b></color> - turn

    <b>FINGER</b>
    - touch the switchboard buttons to press them'
  hinglish: '<color=#5AA5FF><b>GRIP</b></color> (side button) - cheezein pakdo, darwaze
    ka handle kheecho

    <color=#F2A33A><b>TRIGGER</b></color> - haath mein pakde
    remote ka button dabao (TV / Fan)

    <color=#7CE68C><b>LEFT STICK</b></color>
    - chalo        <color=#7CE68C><b>RIGHT STICK</b></color> - ghoomo

    <b>UNGLI</b>
    - switchboard ke button ko chhu ke dabao'
