  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Is ghar mein sab kuch kharab hai - aur tumhe har kaam <b>JUGAAD</b> se
    karna hai.


    - TV ka remote toota hai, darwaze pe tala hai, chaabi kho gayi
    hai...

    - Aas-paas ki cheezon se kaam chalao: safety pin, rubber band, magnet,
    kitaab...

    - Kul <b>7 tasks</b> hain. Jitna jaldi karoge, utne zyada points
    (har task 1000 tak).

    - Atak gaye? Kuch der baad <b>HINT</b> aayega - par
    us task ke points 20% kam.

    - End mein milega tumhara rank: Naya Jugaadu,
    Pakka Jugaadu ya <b>JUGAAD MASTER!</b>'
