--- !u!114 &2094527140
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2094527136}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 98aa47f3b4fa1f74d824cc049cc81edf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  english: 'Everything in this house is broken - and you have to get every job done
    with <b>JUGAAD</b>.


    - The TV remote is broken, the door is locked, the
    key is lost...

    - Make do with what''s around you: safety pin, rubber band,
    magnet, books...

    - There are <b>7 tasks</b>. The faster you finish, the
    more points you get (up to 1000 per task).

    - Stuck? A <b>HINT</b> appears
    after a while - but that task gives 20% fewer points.

    - At the end you get
    your rank: Newbie Jugaadu, Pro Jugaadu or <b>JUGAAD MASTER!</b>'
  hinglish: 'Is ghar mein sab kuch kharab hai - aur tumhe har kaam <b>JUGAAD</b>
    se karna hai.


    - TV ka remote toota hai, darwaze pe tala hai, chaabi kho
    gayi hai...

    - Aas-paas ki cheezon se kaam chalao: safety pin, rubber band,
    magnet, kitaab...

    - Kul <b>7 tasks</b> hain. Jitna jaldi karoge, utne zyada
    points (har task 1000 tak).

    - Atak gaye? Kuch der baad <b>HINT</b> aayega
    - par us task ke points 20% kam.

    - End mein milega tumhara rank: Naya Jugaadu,
    Pakka Jugaadu ya <b>JUGAAD MASTER!</b>'
